SAM 2: Segment Anything in Images and Videos

This directory contains a vendored fork of Meta's SAM 2 codebase, used
by EgoInfinity for streaming object mask tracking in Phase D.

Upstream: https://github.com/facebookresearch/sam2
Original License: Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE)

Modifications, where present, are localized engineering integrations
(IPC worker bindings, mask-cache helpers) and do not alter the model or
training procedure.

Citation:
  Ravi, N., et al. "SAM 2: Segment Anything in Images and Videos."
  arXiv:2408.00714, 2024.
